{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/deployment/","title":"Deploying a CraftTS application","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"deploying-a-craftts-application","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Deploying a CraftTS application"}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"warning","caption":"Experimental","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The deployment tooling is the newest part of CraftTS and it is "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"not settled"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"What is written here works and is covered by tests, but the CLI surface, the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"manifest fields and the diagnostic codes can still change between minor"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"versions. Pin the version if you build a pipeline on it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Concretely, as of today: "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts check"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"manifest"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"providers"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"deploy preview"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"deploy"},{"t":"text","text":" exist; "},{"t":"code","text":"init"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"build"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"deploy init"},{"t":"text","text":" do not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"yet. One provider implementation ships, "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/deployment/alchemy","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy"}]},{"t":"text","text":", and no real"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"deployment has been run from the CraftTS repository itself."}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A CraftTS application describes its deployment once, in a typed manifest, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that description is enough to check it, to build it and to hand it to a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"provider. Nothing in the manifest names a hosting company, so moving from a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"container to a Worker, or from one publisher to another, does not touch the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"server-functions or the routes."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"three-notions-that-never-merge","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Three notions that never merge"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Notion"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Question it answers"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Values"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"runtime"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"What execution shape does the bundle take?"}],[{"t":"code","text":"static"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"node"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"worker"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"lambda"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"platform"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"Which technical platform executes that shape?"}],[{"t":"code","text":"node"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"docker"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"cloudflare"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"aws"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"vercel"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"netlify"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"firebase"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"github-pages"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"provider"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"Which integration builds, publishes or provisions it?"}],[{"t":"code","text":"alchemy"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"docker"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"cloudflare-pages"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"vercel"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"netlify"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"firebase"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"github-pages"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy is a provider of infrastructure, not a runtime. Cloudflare Pages is a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"provider of publication for the same artefact. Both read the same manifest."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The "},{"t":"code","text":"static"},{"t":"text","text":" runtime carries a mode:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"code","text":"spa"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — one document, and unknown paths fall back to it. The route table"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"lives in the browser."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"code","text":"ssg"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — one pre-rendered document per route. The route list is part of the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"contract, and any route that cannot be reduced to a single document has to be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declared as needing a server runtime."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-manifest","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The manifest"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { defineCraftDeployment } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/deploy'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"default","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"defineCraftDeployment","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  name: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'demo-ssr'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  runtime: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'node'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  platform: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'docker'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  server: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    entry: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'dist/apps/demo-ssr/server/server.js'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    source: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'apps/demo-ssr/src/production-server.ts'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    healthPath: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'/health'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    readyPath: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'/ready'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The runtime discriminates the type: a "},{"t":"code","text":"worker"},{"t":"text","text":" manifest cannot carry an SSR"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"entry, and a "},{"t":"code","text":"node"},{"t":"text","text":" manifest cannot omit its health and readiness routes. See"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/deployment/manifest","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"manifest reference"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for every field."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-commands","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The commands"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"check","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--provider","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"docker","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"manifest","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--out","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"dist/apps/demo-ssr/craft-deployment-manifest.json","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"providers","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"deploy","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"preview","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--provider","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"alchemy","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--stage","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"staging","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"deploy","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--provider","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"alchemy","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--stage","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"staging","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"check"},{"t":"text","text":" runs before the build. It resolves the manifest, then verifies the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declared paths, the runtime/platform pair, the capabilities of the chosen"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"provider and the module graph of the runtime entry — a Node built-in reachable"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"from a Worker entry, an SSR entry that never serves its own health route, an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"environment variable read but never declared. Add "},{"t":"code","text":"--artifact"},{"t":"text","text":" after the build"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"to inspect the directory a provider would actually upload."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every path in the manifest is relative to the directory "},{"t":"code","text":"check"},{"t":"text","text":" runs from,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"which is "},{"t":"code","text":"--root"},{"t":"text","text":" when given and the current directory otherwise. In a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"monorepo, run the commands from the workspace root and point "},{"t":"code","text":"--config"},{"t":"text","text":" at the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"application:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"check","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--config","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/demo-ssr/craft.deploy.ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--provider","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"docker","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"manifest"},{"t":"text","text":" resolves the manifest to its artefact form: every default applied,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"keys sorted, protocol version stamped. Two builds of the same input produce a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"byte-identical file, which is what makes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"dist/<app>/craft-deployment-manifest.json"},{"t":"text","text":" an immutable artefact."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"providers"},{"t":"text","text":" prints the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/deployment/providers","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"capability matrix"}]},{"t":"text","text":". A provider listed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"there is documented; the integration that deploys it is installed separately."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"deploy preview"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"deploy"},{"t":"text","text":" hand the checked manifest to that integration."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The CLI resolves "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/deploy-<name>"},{"t":"text","text":" from the project at run time, so it"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"depends on no provider itself. "},{"t":"code","text":"preview"},{"t":"text","text":" never mutates anything, and "},{"t":"code","text":"deploy"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"runs the same checks and the same preview before it applies, refusing until"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"--yes"},{"t":"text","text":" approves the plan. "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/deployment/alchemy","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy"}]},{"t":"text","text":" is the provider that ships"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"today."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-the-tooling-never-does","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What the tooling never does"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It never writes a secret. The manifest declares the "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"names"}]},{"t":"text","text":" of the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"environment variables and whether they are required; a declared value is a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reported error."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It never mutates an infrastructure by itself. Publishing and provisioning"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"belong to a provider package, and applying a plan always needs "},{"t":"code","text":"--yes"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It never replaces the build. "},{"t":"code","text":"check"},{"t":"text","text":" reads what the build declares and what"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it produced; Vite, Nx and the application scripts stay in charge."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"where-to-go-next","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Where to go next"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/deployment/manifest","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Manifest reference"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — every field, every default."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/deployment/diagnostics","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Diagnostics"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — every code, its cause and its fix."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/deployment/providers","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Providers"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — the capability matrix and the limits of each"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"entry."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/deployment/alchemy","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy provider"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — credentials, state, stages, outputs and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rollback for the infrastructure provider."}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"three-notions-that-never-merge","text":"Three notions that never merge"},{"level":2,"id":"the-manifest","text":"The manifest"},{"level":2,"id":"the-commands","text":"The commands"},{"level":2,"id":"what-the-tooling-never-does","text":"What the tooling never does"},{"level":2,"id":"where-to-go-next","text":"Where to go next"}]}